  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "In a non-leap year,total number of days is 365 . Out of them, there are 52 weeks and 1 day extra. Thus, a non-leap year always has 52 Sunday. The remaining 1 day can be Sunday, Monday, Tuenday, Wednesday, Thursday, Friday and Sarurday. Out of these 7 cases, we have Sunday in one\r\ncase\r\n$\\therefore$ Total number of outcomes = 7 \r\nNumber of favourable outcomes = 1\r\nHence, required probability $=\\frac{1}{7}$",
    "image": null
  },
